# Magic UI (magic-ui-dev)

React 19 + React Router 7 (SPA, `ssr: false`) + Vite 6 + TanStack Query v5 + Tailwind v4 + shadcn/ui (Radix). App code lives under `app/`, path alias `~/` → `app/`.

## Authoritative docs (read before large changes)

Start from `app/docs/README.md`, then open the numbered topic files (`01-` … `14-`) under `app/docs/` as needed. Code templates live in `app/docs/examples/` (templates only; not imported by the app).

## Hard rules

- HTTP: only `import api from "~/api/axios"` — never `axios.create`.
- Query keys: only `EQueryKey` from `~/constants/queryKeys` — no string literals.
- Mutations: invalidate every dependent cache (`PROJECT_TREE`, `PROJECT_SUBSYSTEM`, `PROJECT_PRICE_DATA`, `PROJECT_DATA`, `SUBSYSTEM_BILLING` when relevant).
- Routes: declared in `app/routes.ts`; page components default-export from `app/routes/*.tsx`.
- Subsystem URL depth: use `useEffectiveSubsystemId()` for the current subsystem id — do not re-parse splat paths ad hoc.

## Style

Match existing files: `cn()` from `~/lib/utils`, shadcn primitives from `~/components/ui`, project composites under `~/components/customComponents`. Prefer focused diffs; do not refactor unrelated code.
